<title>MOROCCO: Ship sinks, killing two in Morocco, seven missing.</title>
<headline>Ship sinks, killing two in Morocco, seven missing.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two fishermen died and seven were reported missing after a fishing vessel sank near the coastal city of Larache, 210 km (130 miles) north of Rabat, Moroccan news agency MAP said on Monday.</p>
<p>MAP said only three people of the 12 aboard were found alive after the ship capsized on Saturday night.</p>
